Permanent implementation
- Added UniversalPromotedProfileProvenancePresentation. Null maps to hidden/empty state. A real projection copies exact promoted ProfileId/name/ProfileKind, stable GameId, AdapterId and deterministic exact UniversalCandidate key/value lines.
- Added PromotedWinnerProvenanceView. It starts collapsed, uses the bound PerformanceProfile only as the request ID, calls App.Services.ResolveCurrentUniversalPersistedPromotedProfileProvenanceAsync, and renders only the pure presentation result.
