- Added a separate read-only "Proveniência universal dos vencedores" section to ProfilesPage.xaml.
- Existing ProfilesList, ApplyProfile_Click, ProfilesPage.xaml.cs, Custom provenance card and challenge flows are unchanged.
- Null promoted provenance keeps the view collapsed and does not alter the specialized winner.

